Kingdom Kids Day Care & Academy"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-159296-i20230414-v5","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-2803-4-a","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-159296-i20230414","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-159296","date":"2023-04-14","original_code":"746.2803(4)(A)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","severity_rank":2,"source_category":"Medium High","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2023-04-28","finding":"Positive Methods of Discipline and Guidance - Use Praise and Encouragement: A caregiver was not using positive guidance when communicating with children about inappropriate behavior. They were additionally raising their voice and using a harsh tone.","topic":"other","source_record_id":"1026242271","facility_name":"Pleasant Valley Baptist Church"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-131230-i20230224-v2","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-2803-4-a","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-131230-i20230224","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-131230","date":"2023-02-24","original_code":"746.2803(4)(A)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","severity_rank":2,"source_category":"Medium High","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2023-03-01","finding":"Positive Methods of Discipline and Guidance - Use Praise and Encouragement: Classroom interactions were observed with the classroom that is mixed with older infants and toddlers. The caregiver rarely communicated with the children in a positive manner and was very overly firm with her demands to the children that is not appropriate for their developmental level. Additionally the children were disciplined negatively for wanting to play with toys when they had already transitioned from lunch time and story time and had not had an opportunity to play in over an hour.","topic":"facilities","source_record_id":"1026520347","facility_name":"Bright Beginnings"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1308375-i20230203-v1","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-2803-4-a","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1308375-i20230203","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-1308375","date":"