er was observed not using positive interaction with a three year old in care by sitting the child down forcefully and using harsh tones when instructing the child on what to do.","topic":"other","source_record_id":"1026510962","facility_name":"Kids Are Angels Learning Center"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-116984-i20220721-v1","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-2803-4-a","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-116984-i20220721","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-116984","date":"2022-07-21","original_code":"746.2803(4)(A)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","severity_rank":2,"source_category":"Medium High","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-08-02","finding":"Positive Methods of Discipline and Guidance - Use Praise and Encouragement: A caregiver was observed on video grabbing several children by one arm and forcibly moving them from one place to the other in the classroom.","topic":"facilities","source_record_id":"1026555166","facility_name":"La Petite Academy"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-114141-i20220506-v3","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-2803-4-a","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-114141-i20220506","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-114141","date":"2022-05-06","original_code":"746.2803(4)(A)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","severity_rank":2,"source_category":"Medium High","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-05-31","finding":"Positive Methods of Discipline and Guidance - Use Praise and Encouragement: A staff in the 3-5 year old class was using phrases like \"hush,\"\"Cera,\"\"stop doing that,\" and \"get over here\" during the visit. Her voice was sturn, firm, and louder than her normal voice.","topic":"other","source_record_id":"1026351458","facility_name":"Burnham Rd Kindercare"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1363695-i20220412-v14","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-2803-4-a","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1363695-i20220412","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-1363695","date":"2022-04-12","original_code":"746.2803(4)(A)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium